---
/** About: the "About us" copy with the tender box photo. */
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import box from '../assets/tender-box-grill.jpg';
---
<section data-section="about" aria-labelledby="about-h2" class="bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
      <h2 id="about-h2" class="font-display font-bold uppercase text-accent text-5xl sm:text-6xl leading-none">About us.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 font-body text-xl leading-snug text-ink">For over 22 years, Brado's has been part of the Shellharbour area. Built on community, driven by people and proud to be local, we've become more than just a place to eat. We're part of everyday moments, shared meals and the routines people come back to.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-body text-xl leading-snug text-ink">It's not just the food. It's the connection, the familiarity and the feeling of being part of something local.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 font-display font-semibold uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Happiness in every bite.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-1 lg:order-2">
      <Picture src={box} alt="Hands reaching for crispy tenders and dipping sauces in a takeaway box on a grill" widths={[640, 1024, 1400]} formats={['avif', 'webp']} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
